# SHIP step 3: the license, the decision log, and the evidence.
# Format: file | regular expression the file must contain | message if it doesn't
LICENSE | ^MIT License | must be the MIT license, starting with its name
docs/decisions.md | ^# [^#[:space:]] | must start with a title
docs/decisions.md | ^\| | needs a table of decisions
docs/decisions.md | 2026- | must date each decision
evidence/README.md | ^# [^#[:space:]] | must start with a title
evidence/README.md | ^\| | needs a table: one row per test
evidence/README.md | /pull/ | must link the pull request that holds the transcript
evidence/README.md | THREATS_FOUND | must name the verdict the malware test produced
